{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46151","headline":"春晚桐江上闲望作 · 贯休","name":"春晚桐江上闲望作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上车声落日催，纷纷扰扰起红埃。\n更无人望青山立，空有帆冲夜色来。\n沙鸟似云钟外去，汀花如火雨中开。\n可怜潇洒鸱夷子，散发扁舟去不回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}